title: Authorizations › New case › Agents work › Start the run and watch it
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (step 3 of 4, 'Agents work')
intro: 'Continue' on step 2 asks once, then ten agents work in order for about 13 seconds. The page shows each agent's line, the approval chance climbing, two ways to raise it, and Pause and Skip ahead. A paused agent holds the run, and Verify can fail to reach a payer's portal. All progress is written to the draft.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "On step 2, click 'Continue'\nEvery required item is in"
overlay o1 "Start the agents?\nJ.M., Residential 3.5 · Summit Medicaid HMO\n'Scribe drafts the case and may ask you a question or two.'\n'Nothing is sent to the payer until a clinician signs.'"
click cCancel "Click 'Cancel', press Escape, or click outside"
endx eCancel "Back on step 2; nothing started"
click cStart "Click 'Start the agents'"
store st1 "Draft saved as a case with an ID such as R-1701\nIt now shows in Case Manager › Being prepared"
store st2 "Run set up\nChance range from the payer: 62% to 88% for Summit\nQuestions planned: one, or two when the chart leaves a gap\nClock set from the request type"
screen sc "Step 3 'Agents work'\n'Agents at work on R-1701'\n'Residential 3.5 admission · Summit Medicaid HMO' and a clock chip that counts up"
process pRow "Each agent row goes 'Waiting', then 'Working' with a spinner, then a green tick with its time"

group gRun "Ten agents, in this order"
  agent a1 "Reader · 1.3 s\n'Read 8 files and found 214 facts. Identifiers are now codes'"
  agent a2 "Verify · 1.0 s\n'Coverage is active and prior authorization is required'\nFirst run for Cardinal: it cannot reach the portal and stops"
  agent a3 "Criteria · 1.4 s\n'Matched the chart to Summit's criteria: 9 of 9 requirements met'"
  agent a4 "Historian · 1.3 s\n'Reviewed 1,248 similar Summit decisions: 212 your own, 806 network, 230 benchmark'"
  agent a5 "Placement · 1.0 s\n'The chart supports Residential 3.5 (ASAM 3.5)'"
  agent a6 "Forecaster · 1.1 s\n'Approval chance 88%, likely 83-92%'"
  agent a7 "Scribe · 2.2 s\nStops to ask its question (two when the chart leaves a gap), then 'Drafted the medical-necessity summary'"
  agent a8 "Integrity · 1.4 s\n'Every sentence traces to the chart'"
  agent a9 "Packet · 1.3 s\n'Assembled Summit's form with 8 attachments'"
  agent a10 "Scrubber · 1.0 s\n'Checked the request for errors. None found'"
endgroup

group gChance "Approval chance panel"
  process pRing "Ring starts at 62% ('started at 62%')\nIt climbs as Verify, Criteria, Historian and Placement finish: 65, 72, 78, 83"
  process pPill "Pill: 'Moderate so far · likely 53-70%'"
  process pSettle "After Forecaster: 88%\nPill: 'Strong · likely 83-92%'\n'Based on 1,248 similar cases'"
  process pHeld "Below the pill: 'Held back 3 points: 1 thing the payer asks for is not met.'\nThree points for each required document that is not in the case, and for a start date the payer's backdating rule does not allow, up to 12"
endgroup

group gRaise "To raise it further"
  click cTick1 "Tick 'Name the step-down provider'\n+2-4"
  click cTick2 "Tick 'Attach the 2025 IOP discharge summary'\n+1-3"
  process pBoost "Chance goes up 3 or 2 points, never above 97%\nThe summary will be rebuilt with an extra line"
  click cUntick "Untick a box\nThe points come off"
endgroup

group gFoot "Footer buttons"
  click cPause "Click 'Pause all agents'\nSame as 'Pause all agents' in Settings: the whole app is paused"
  toast tPause "Banner 'Agents are paused in Settings'\nRow: 'Paused in Settings'\nThe run holds at the agent it was on"
  click cResume "Click 'Resume agents'\nSettings shows them resumed too"
  click cSkip "Click 'Skip ahead'"
  process pFast "Each step now takes about 0.14 s\nThe button switches off\nA question still stops the run"
  click cBack "Click 'Back'"
endgroup

toast tRec "Banner 'Records changed after the last run. The agents re-checked.'\nShown when the medical records changed after an earlier run"
process pAway "Leave the page and progress is kept in the draft\nBut the agents only move while this page is open\nHint: 'The agents work on their own. You can leave and come back.'"
goto g46 "Continues in: Agents work › An agent could not finish"
goto g47 "Continues in: Agents work › Paused in Settings"
goto g35 "Continues in: Agents work › An agent asks a question"
goto g36 "Continues in: Agents work › Finished, paused or left"

s1 --> o1
o1 --> cCancel --> eCancel
o1 --> cStart --> st1 --> st2 --> sc --> pRow --> a1
a1 --> a2 --> a3 --> a4 --> a5 --> a6 --> a7 --> a8 --> a9 --> a10 --> g36
a7 -.->|Stops once| g35

sc --> pRing --> pPill --> pSettle --> pHeld
a6 -.-> pSettle
sc --> tRec
a2 -.->|Cardinal, first run| g46

sc --> cTick1 --> pBoost
sc --> cTick2 --> pBoost
pBoost --> cUntick

sc --> cPause --> tPause --> cResume
tPause --> g47
sc --> cSkip --> pFast
sc --> cBack --> g36
sc --> pAway --> g36
